cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this computational companion, please cite this repository release. Cite the associated research article separately when available."
title: "TB Undernutrition Proteomics Computational Companion"
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rmaghembe1/tb-undernutrition-proteomics"
authors:
  - family-names: "Maghembe"
    given-names: "Reuben S."
abstract: "Portable publication-facing computational companion for longitudinal secondary analysis of serum proteomics during tuberculosis treatment across BMI-defined undernutrition strata. The repository contains sanitized aggregate outputs, a participant-independent curated module mapping, the original four-stage analytical workflow, and authenticated post hoc Reviewer 2 revision analyses."
keywords:
  - tuberculosis
  - undernutrition
  - serum proteomics
  - longitudinal analysis
  - nutritional-metabolic remodeling
  - computational reproducibility
license: MIT
